OK   10(b) divide and conquer on a topologically sorted dag: R_XY = R_X A_XY R_Y
OK   10(c) strong components + (b) on the component dag
OK   10(d) boolean product read off the closure of the 3n-vertex layered graph
OK   10(b) the recursion makes exactly 2(n-1) products of size <= n/2 (two per internal node)
